OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 17 MAY
OL,4,G1900FSunday Feature: South African
OL,5,     FArias
OL,6,     GLindsay Johns explores the
OL,7,     Gflourishing of operatic talent in
OL,8,     Gpost-Apartheid South Africa.
OL,9,G1945FWords and Music
OL,10,     GCelebrating wildflowers like the
OL,11,     Gbluebell, with poetry from Emily
OL,12,     GBronte and CM Barker's The Flower
OL,13,     GFairies; and nettles and other
OL,14,     Gweeds with Edward Thomas and
OL,15,     GMarguerite Duras.
OL,16,G2100FUltimate Calm with Erland Cooper
OL,17,     GGather by the fireside with
OL,18,     GErland Cooper for a warming
OL,19,     Gselection of luminous sounds.
OL,20,     GPlus ethereal musician Bat for
OL,21,     GLashes shares her musical safe
OL,22,     Ghaven.
